{"id":"8b5c639a9a65f115d9e0eea168f85c2bf4d2cc1f","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1250482","title":"感叹 Codex 的过度设计。","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"murongxdb","excerpt":"OpenAI - @murongxdb - 让 Codex 写了一个功能模块（中等复杂度），给它沟通好功能以及边界后，列好开发计划，它持续工作了了 15 个小时左右，写了 2w 行代码，消耗了一整个 20x 账号的 7 周额度，看到后我惊呆了，","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div><p>让 Codex 写了一个功能模块（中等复杂度），给它沟通好功能以及边界后，列好开发计划，它持续工作了了 15 个小时左右，写了 2w 行代码，消耗了一整个 20x 账号的 7 周额度，看到后我惊呆了，我是真不敢合并啊！！！ 2w 行代码 review 都得一星期也够呛完成！！</p></div><div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203407\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d400176bfc6c77673e3a4ca4cc24924e?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"helei\" data-uid=\"88444\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/helei\">helei</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 08:31:59 +08:00\">2h 37m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>感觉这个模型有点心理疾病，过度强迫症和疑神疑鬼，一般这个时候我会让他“将代码缩减到 2000 行，但保持所有单元测试通过”</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203417\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3ae3/1324/171697_normal.png?m=1703596600\" alt=\"geese1028\" data-uid=\"171697\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/geese1028\">geese1028</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 08:34:53 +08:00\">2h 34m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我现在可不敢让 astra 随便跑，我都是让 opus5.5 去盯着。。。。。。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203419\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/78d9/c5c3/469495_normal.png?m=1774244374\" alt=\"murongxdb\" data-uid=\"469495\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/murongxdb\">murongxdb</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 08:35:49 +08:00\">2h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>使用 gpt 6.1 sol fast 一天干了 23 亿 token</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203443\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9f39f8cd478ef2a21d7a6c81949c0eb5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"testsb\" data-uid=\"187502\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/testsb\">testsb</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 08:41:24 +08:00\">2h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>可以用 ponytail 约束一下过度设计</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203457\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fcfea973585d4649d7ff2bdad8c86a1b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xuxingchou\" data-uid=\"762664\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xuxingchou\">xuxingchou</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 08:44:01 +08:00\">2h 25m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>所以我现在都不用 gpt 开发项目，只用 gpt 来写一些简单的脚本以及画图</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203466\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5987/bc50/78391_normal.png?m=1788532163\" alt=\"yidinghe\" data-uid=\"78391\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yidinghe\">yidinghe</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 08:46:36 +08:00\">2h 22m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>如果这个功能真的要 2w 行代码，又有什么关系，测试通过就行了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203532\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a32d5d54872f1faef371b55921768d5e?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"achira\" data-uid=\"472362\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/achira\">achira</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 09:02:07 +08:00\">2h 7m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>你不发提示词和上下文，我很难为你发声啊。<br>你说你指挥了，但他落实得有偏差我还能帮你说一下，你自己没限制好怪谁？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203536\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f7b4/469d/469348_normal.png?m=1581758320\" alt=\"gibber\" data-uid=\"469348\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gibber\">gibber</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 09:04:08 +08:00\">2h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你用 claude 也不一定能符合你的预期</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203546\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6c2b/646b/621283_normal.png?m=1692511549\" alt=\"gpt5\" data-uid=\"621283\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gpt5\">gpt5</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 09:05:41 +08:00\">2h 3m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我好几次做噩梦，我一觉醒来，发现吭哧吭哧干了一晚上，把我的额度都用光了。。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203554\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/78d9/c5c3/469495_normal.png?m=1774244374\" alt=\"murongxdb\" data-uid=\"469495\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/murongxdb\">murongxdb</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 09:07:24 +08:00\">2h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/achira\">achira</a> 上下文太多，发不出来，提示词大概就是我跟 ai 说了一个功能，让他给我生成了一个 prd ，然后列了一个开发计划，就让他开始了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203578\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0b33/2451/535743_normal.png?m=1787642481\" alt=\"wetalk\" data-uid=\"535743\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wetalk\">wetalk</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 09:13:01 +08:00\">1h 56m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/geese1028\">geese1028</a> #2  opus5.5 盯着啥意思，还能让 opus5.5 盯着 gpt 干活么，这需要模型之间实时通信吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203595\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9406/46f3/619857_normal.png?m=1784340758\" alt=\"Nu1lXX\" data-uid=\"619857\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Nu1lXX\">Nu1lXX</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 09:16:17 +08:00\">1h 53m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>是的啊，我正在遭受这样的折磨。让它煮鸡蛋，它可以把消防车喊到楼下，厨房配备全套灭火装备，依旧还没开始煮鸡蛋</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203596\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d95f7fc49a312f6a2c2671f9a63f04ea?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zhady009\" data-uid=\"262575\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zhady009\">zhady009</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 09:16:34 +08:00\">1h 52m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>其实纯写代码消耗没那么大，最好看下是不是有什么硬性流程的提示词</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203627\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6932/f315/443031_normal.png?m=1756988094\" alt=\"Mandelo\" data-uid=\"443031\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Mandelo\">Mandelo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 09:22:46 +08:00\">1h 46m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>现在 PLUS 慢的要死，已经无法工作了，还好 claude 还没被封</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203628\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ccd70ad1a3502a6b61cb1690b88468ba?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"coryxu\" data-uid=\"537189\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/coryxu\">coryxu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 09:22:59 +08:00\">1h 46m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我也遇到跟你一样的情况，后面充了 claude 就没遇过了，还感觉额度挺耐用的。<br>我之前测过同一个复杂需求，gpt 改了 2 个小时（结果惨不忍睹，感觉就是让它造飞机，它给我造了一个猎鹰战斗机，而且还飞不起来）<br>claude 只用了 40 分钟（非常完美，结果符合我脑子的构想，我直接瘫坐在凳子上）</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203677\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b4b3448fdb9c5cc4ea62babbd10b45f6?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jerseyhero\" data-uid=\"81419\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jerseyhero\">jerseyhero</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 09:30:06 +08:00\">1h 39m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>深有同感，现在看着 codex 产的代码，有种望洋兴叹，生无可恋的感觉 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/YGIx7lh.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YGIx7lh.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203715\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3ae3/1324/171697_normal.png?m=1703596600\" alt=\"geese1028\" data-uid=\"171697\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/geese1028\">geese1028</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 09:35:18 +08:00\">1h 34m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/wetalk\">wetalk</a> 在 opus 里制定合同、细节、边界、交付物，让 opus 去驱动 astra 干活，然后 opus 验收。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203723\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3ae3/1324/171697_normal.png?m=1703596600\" alt=\"geese1028\" data-uid=\"171697\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>26</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/geese1028\">geese1028</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 09:36:08 +08:00\">1h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/murongxdb\">murongxdb</a> cursor 、antigravity 都送 opus5.5 ，就是额度很有限，但是我觉得也跟 opus 的 pro 订阅差不多了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203871\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3ae3/1324/171697_normal.png?m=1703596600\" alt=\"geese1028\" data-uid=\"171697\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>31</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/geese1028\">geese1028</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 09:54:32 +08:00\">1h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/kksyy\">kksyy</a> 俩加起来 T_T ，我的 cursor 是 ultra ，薅的 super grok heavy 的 100 刀/月的羊毛。grok 退了但是 cursor 还在。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203947\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/57b94f7f153f3745286c0b8db7131786?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"layxy\" data-uid=\"428568\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>32</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/layxy\">layxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 10:03:39 +08:00\">1h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>xhigh 看着分数高，实际开发的时候极容易过度设计，代码写的也极其的复杂和绕，读起来费劲</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203989\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6935/8dc4/176751_normal.png?m=1778548792\" alt=\"Jiahim\" data-uid=\"176751\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>33</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Jiahim\">Jiahim</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 10:08:46 +08:00\">1h 0m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>我感觉不是 codex 的锅，想问下你是不是装了 superpowers……</p><p>我唯一一次跑了一天的，就是用了 superpowers ，后面我直接删掉这个插件了，后面再怎么久，也没有遇到你说的这个情况。</p><p>下面是那次一天跑了我将近 8 亿 token ，花了 16 小时，从前一天晚上跑到第二天下午</p><p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/i/4zWAqh13.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" title=\"在新窗口打开图片 4zWAqh13.png\"><img src=\"//i.v2ex.co/4zWAqh13.png\"></a></p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18204019\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d95f7fc49a312f6a2c2671f9a63f04ea?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zhady009\" data-uid=\"262575\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>34</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zhady009\">zhady009</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 10:13:42 +08:00\">55 mins ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/murongxdb\">murongxdb</a> 是检查一下是不是装的某些 SKILL 影响了，还有就是项目里的 AGETNS 还有输入的提示词，比如#33 的 superpowers 。据我使用的经验 GPT 写代码不会那么久的消耗也没那么夸张，我的提示词环境比较干净只有一些个人的代码风格。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18204026\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e44ed1cd4c25db8e64931d37e93f8f51?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"kosilence\" data-uid=\"214244\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>35</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kosilence\">kosilence</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 10:15:15 +08:00\">54 mins ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我一般都是让它写完设计方案之后，再重新审查一遍有没有过度设计，然后再找 agent 执行</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18204050\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/78d9/c5c3/469495_normal.png?m=1774244374\" alt=\"murongxdb\" data-uid=\"469495\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>37</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/murongxdb\">murongxdb</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 10:18:54 +08:00\">50 mins ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Jiahim\">Jiahim</a> superpowers 早就弃用了，这次的情况纯粹就是 codex 过度设计了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18204076\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3975/6000/662828_normal.png?m=1778314902\" alt=\"ktyang\" data-uid=\"662828\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>38</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ktyang\">ktyang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 10:22:18 +08:00\">47 mins ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不要过度设计这个提示词已经贯穿了我的开发全过程了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18204165\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/824f12cd60fa42902091388bc0820aad?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"forbreak\" data-uid=\"82516\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>40</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/forbreak\">forbreak</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 10:31:28 +08:00\">38 mins ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我最近用了两周的额度让他执行一个计划，结果用两周额度写了一堆单元测试和数据纠错。 然后计划整体进度进行不到 10%。我周末几天跑到，周一一看气死了。 相当于一点都功能都没推进，空转了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18204317\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4f72/8a53/154984_normal.png?m=1770813913\" alt=\"ppwangs\" data-uid=\"154984\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>41</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ppwangs\">ppwangs</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 10:50:24 +08:00\">19 mins ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>似乎是这样，而且最近很慢。<br>我已经在提示词和 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://AGENTS.md\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">AGENTS.md</a> 以及宪法要求不做过度设计，并且有详细的设计过程，在实际开发过程中还是会有过度的情况。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"让 Codex 写了一个功能模块（中等复杂度），给它沟通好功能以及边界后，列好开发计划，它持续工作了了 15 个小时左右，写了 2w 行代码，消耗了一整个 20x 账号的 7 周额度，看到后我惊呆了，我是真不敢合并啊！！！ 2w 行代码 review 都得一星期也够呛完成！！ 1 helei 2h 37m ago via iPhone 感觉这个模型有点心理疾病，过度强迫症和疑神疑鬼，一般这个时候我会让他“将代码缩减到 2000 行，但保持所有单元测试通过” 2 geese1028 2h 34m ago 我现在可不敢让 astra 随便跑，我都是让 opus5.5 去盯着。。。。。。 3 murongxdb OPPRO 2h 33m ago 使用 gpt 6.1 sol fast 一天干了 23 亿 token 6 testsb 2h 28m ago 可以用 ponytail 约束一下过度设计 7 xuxingchou 2h 25m ago 所以我现在都不用 gpt 开发项目，只用 gpt 来写一些简单的脚本以及画图 10 yidinghe PRO 2h 22m ago via Android 如果这个功能真的要 2w 行代码，又有什么关系，测试通过就行了 14 achira 2h 7m ago 1 你不发提示词和上下文，我很难为你发声啊。你说你指挥了，但他落实得有偏差我还能帮你说一下，你自己没限制好怪谁？ 15 gibber 2h 5m ago 你用 claude 也不一定能符合你的预期 16 gpt5 2h 3m ago 我好几次做噩梦，我一觉醒来，发现吭哧吭哧干了一晚上，把我的额度都用光了。。 17 murongxdb OPPRO 2h 2m ago @achira 上下文太多，发不出来，提示词大概就是我跟 ai 说了一个功能，让他给我生成了一个 prd ，然后列了一个开发计划，就让他开始了 18 wetalk 1h 56m ago @geese1028 #2 opus5.5 盯着啥意思，还能让 opus5.5 盯着 gpt 干活么，这需要模型之间实时通信吧 19 Nu1lXX 1h 53m ago 是的啊，我正在遭受这样的折磨。让它煮鸡蛋，它可以把消防车喊到楼下，厨房配备全套灭火装备，依旧还没开始煮鸡蛋 20 zhady009 1h 52m ago 其实纯写代码消耗没那么大，最好看下是不是有什么硬性流程的提示词 21 Mandelo 1h 